=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
The best performing combination was TextRank with InferSent (0.04003 mean ROUGE-2, from Table 2), i.e., the combination of the statistical/graphical model with the InferSent-based semantic model [5][3]. The InferSent based Summarizer also performed exceptionally well as a base model (0.03812 ROUGE-2 in Table 1), while WordNet and GloVe-based semantic models performed average [4][3].
